StormD (StormOS Debian Edition) -- Licenses & Credits
=====================================================

StormD is built from build files based on eznixOS 13X by eznix. The build
script (bldeznix13X) carries eznix's original license header, reproduced
here together with his disclaimer, re-included verbatim:

    bldeznix13X -- Revision: 13X -- by eznix (https://sourceforge.net/projects/eznixos/)
    (GNU/General Public License version 3.0)

