Credits
-------

* eznix -- eznixOS (https://sourceforge.net/projects/eznixos/): the eznix13X
  live-build base, scripts, and desktop design that StormD is derived from.
* Ben Fitzpatrick (bfitzgit23) -- StormD (StormOS Debian Edition): adaptation
  of the eznix13X build, StormOS branding, and maintenance.
Changes requested for StormD (vs. the eznix13X base)
----------------------------------------------------

* Created StormD (Debian) build files: Debian trixie live-build derived
  from eznix13X (fa0aee577)
* Added curated wallpapers to StormD backgrounds (excluding
  arch/manjaro/by_MM) (61dd683c5)
* Ship flatpak, gnome-software + flathub pre-enabled (71d494e67)
* Ship compiz 0.8 from the repos + StormD compiz setup (4dc7fea2d)

